    "description": "FAQs\n\nWhat is a Marvel Tokon Launch Party?\nA community event with Marvel Tokon, casual play, tournaments, music, food, and drinks.\n\nDo I need a controller?\nNo - PS5 controllers are provided, or bring your own compatible controller.\n\nCan I join the tournament?\nYes! Register online. On-site registration is subject to availability.\n\nWill there be other games?\nYes - Super Smash Bros. Ultimate, Pok\u00e9mon Champions and Avatar Legends.\n\nAre there prizes?\nYes! The Top 6 Marvel Tokon players win a free game copy, plus a \u20b945,000 prize pool across the other tournaments.\n\nDo I need to own the game?\nNo. Game stations will be available for everyone.\n\nWill there be music?\nYes! Live DJ sets all day featuring Robu, Insowmya, Vidur Grover, and Red$uzuki95.\n\nWill there be food & drinks?\nYes. Food, beer, gin, vodka, and whisky will be available for purchase.\n\nIs this a 21+ event?\nNo. Alcohol is served only to guests of legal drinking age with valid government-issued ID.",
